    "updated_at": "2022-02-18T22:22:36Z",
    "body": "Could the meaning of baseline alignment for range inputs be changed so that the visible track directly sits on the baseline? Like so:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"316\" alt=\"152313431-b56cc2b5-58e5-426b-82c0-f243bb606f44\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/716405/154768933-52a5bd4e-6199-4532-8be3-71a6e197e1ef.png\">\r\n\r\nThat might even be the ideal vertical alignment for this control.\r\n\r\n",
